{
  "name": "n8n-refine-alignment-orchestrator",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "o1",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-320, -420],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 620,
        "height": 340,
        "content": "### Before running anything here\n- Requires **self-hosted n8n** — Execute Command is disabled on n8n Cloud.\n- The host running n8n needs Poetry + `poetry install` already done once (torch/sentence-transformers resolved). Sanity check on that host directly: `poetry run refine-alignment --help`.\n- `workDir` must be the real repo root so `cd {{workDir}} && poetry run ...` picks up `.env` via `load_dotenv()`. If n8n runs in Docker, bind-mount the repo in and set `workDir` to the in-container path.\n- API keys: either that root `.env`, or OS-level env vars on the n8n process itself (systemd/docker-compose). n8n's own Credentials store is NOT passed to Execute Command subprocesses.\n- Raise n8n's `EXECUTIONS_TIMEOUT` before running more than a couple of chapters — async batch-mode passes can take minutes to ~1 hour each.\n- No overlap protection: don't trigger two runs against the same config+corpus+overlapping chapters concurrently.\n- **After importing**, every \"Run Chapter (...)\" Execute Workflow node here points at a placeholder — open each one and repoint it at your imported copy of `n8n-refine-retry-chapter.json`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "o2",
      "name": "Run: One Chapter Or Range",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-320, 0],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "o3",
      "name": "Configure Run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-60, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "1", "name": "workDir", "value": "/home/paulhjwu/text-align", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "2", "name": "config", "value": "BSB", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "3", "name": "corpus", "value": "nt", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "4", "name": "batchMode", "value": "sync", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "5", "name": "maxRetryPasses", "value": 5, "type": "number" },
            { "id": "6", "name": "fallbackThresholdFlag", "value": "", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "7", "name": "scopeType", "value": "chapter", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "8", "name": "chapter", "value": "40004", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "9", "name": "chapterStart", "value": "", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "10", "name": "chapterEnd", "value": "", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "11", "name": "book", "value": "", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "12", "name": "bookStart", "value": "", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "13", "name": "bookEnd", "value": "", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "o4",
      "name": "Build Chapter Args",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [200, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// scopeType is one of: chapter | chapter-range | book | book-range\n// (mirrors refine-alignment's own mutually-exclusive scope flags).\nconst s = $json;\nlet chapterArgs = '';\nif (s.scopeType === 'chapter')       chapterArgs = `--chapter ${s.chapter}`;\nif (s.scopeType === 'chapter-range') chapterArgs = `--chapter-range ${s.chapterStart} ${s.chapterEnd}`;\nif (s.scopeType === 'book')          chapterArgs = `--book ${s.book}`;\nif (s.scopeType === 'book-range')    chapterArgs = `--book-range ${s.bookStart} ${s.bookEnd}`;\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    workDir: s.workDir,\n    config: s.config,\n    corpus: s.corpus,\n    batchMode: s.batchMode,\n    maxRetryPasses: s.maxRetryPasses,\n    fallbackThresholdFlag: s.fallbackThresholdFlag,\n    chapterArgs\n  }\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "o5",
      "name": "Run Chapter (Refine + Retry)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [460, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "n8n-refine-retry-chapter"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "workDir": "={{$json.workDir}}",
            "config": "={{$json.config}}",
            "corpus": "={{$json.corpus}}",
            "chapterArgs": "={{$json.chapterArgs}}",
            "batchMode": "={{$json.batchMode}}",
            "fallbackThresholdFlag": "={{$json.fallbackThresholdFlag}}",
            "maxRetryPasses": "={{$json.maxRetryPasses}}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": false
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "o6",
      "name": "Run: Chapter List",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-320, 340],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "o7",
      "name": "Configure Batch Run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-60, 340],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "1", "name": "workDir", "value": "/home/paulhjwu/text-align", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "2", "name": "config", "value": "BSB", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "3", "name": "corpus", "value": "nt", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "4", "name": "otSection", "value": "", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "5", "name": "batchMode", "value": "sync", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "6", "name": "maxRetryPasses", "value": 5, "type": "number" },
            { "id": "7", "name": "fallbackThresholdFlag", "value": "", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "o8",
      "name": "List Chapters",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, 340],
      "parameters": {
        "command": "=cd {{$json.workDir}} && poetry run python scripts/{{$json.corpus === 'ot' ? 'ot' : 'nt'}}_chapters.py --json{{$json.corpus === 'ot' ? ' --section ' + $json.otSection : ''}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "o9",
      "name": "Parse Chapter List",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [460, 340],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// nt_chapters.py / ot_chapters.py --json both emit a flat array of\n// {id, start, end, label} (verified against scripts/*_chapters.py source).\n// start/end are chapter ids (BBCCC); equal for an unbundled single chapter.\nconst entries = JSON.parse($json.stdout);\nconst ctx = $('Configure Batch Run').item.json;\nreturn entries.map(e => ({\n  json: {\n    workDir: ctx.workDir,\n    config: ctx.config,\n    corpus: ctx.corpus,\n    batchMode: ctx.batchMode,\n    maxRetryPasses: ctx.maxRetryPasses,\n    fallbackThresholdFlag: ctx.fallbackThresholdFlag,\n    chapterArgs: `--chapter-range ${e.start} ${e.end}`,\n    label: e.label\n  }\n}));"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "o10",
      "name": "Loop Over Chapters",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [720, 340],
      "parameters": { "batchSize": 1, "options": {} }
    },
    {
      "id": "o11",
      "name": "Run Chapter (Batch)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [980, 420],
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "n8n-refine-retry-chapter"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "workDir": "={{$json.workDir}}",
            "config": "={{$json.config}}",
            "corpus": "={{$json.corpus}}",
            "chapterArgs": "={{$json.chapterArgs}}",
            "batchMode": "={{$json.batchMode}}",
            "fallbackThresholdFlag": "={{$json.fallbackThresholdFlag}}",
            "maxRetryPasses": "={{$json.maxRetryPasses}}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": false
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "o12",
      "name": "Finalize Batch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [980, 260],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Loop Over Chapters' \"done\" output re-emits every item that was looped —\n// collapse to a single execution of the summary command.\nreturn [{ json: $('Configure Batch Run').item.json }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "o13",
      "name": "Run Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1240, 260],
      "parameters": {
        "command": "=cd {{$json.workDir}} && poetry run python scripts/alignment_summary.py --config {{$json.config}} --corpus {{$json.corpus}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "o14",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Sequential Only",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [720, 560],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 560,
        "height": 200,
        "content": "### Sequential, not parallel\nLoop Over Chapters runs one chapter at a time — n8n has nothing like GHA's 256-way matrix here. Use this branch for a handful of chapters, one book, or re-running specific flagged chapters. For a full NT/OT production run, keep using:\n\n`gh workflow run align-nt.yml -f config=BSB`\n\n(or the OT equivalent, per section)."
      }
    },
    {
